<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italy 2-yr CTZ bill auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for the 2.5 trillion lire auction of a first tranche of March 15, 1999 two-year Italian Treasury zero coupon certificates (CTZ) and 1.5 trillion lire auction of seventh tranche of 18-month July 15, 1998 CTZs.</p>
<p>		    Jul 15, 98  Pvs    Mar 15,'99  Pvs</p>
<p>Net Yield	 6.01 pct    5.73   6.03 pct    5.72</p>
<p>Gross Yield     6.74 pct    6.46   6.86 pct    6.46</p>
<p>Assigned price 91.65	 91.85   87.55	89.15</p>
<p>Bids	     3.933 trillion lire   4.070 trillion lire</p>
<p>Assigned	 1.500 trillion lire   2.500 trillion lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with previous auctions on February 25.</p>
</text>
